  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00239",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "讲完了这番话，我汗流满面，好像说了什么可耻的事似的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After I finished saying this, ",
          "g": "adverbial"
        },
        {
          "t": "I was drenched in sweat, ",
          "g": "predicate"
        },
        {
          "t": "as though I had said something shameful.",
          "g": "adverbial"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00239",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "只有对鹤川一人，我可以袒露自己对于金阁的异乎寻常的执著。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only to Tsurukawa alone ",
          "g": "adverbial"
        },
        {
          "t": "could I reveal ",
          "g": "predicate"
        },
        {
          "t": "my extraordinary attachment to the Golden Pavilion.",
          "g": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00239",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "鹤川在听我这番话的时候，显出一到见惯了的焦躁的表情，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As Tsurukawa listened to what I was saying, ",
          "g": "adverbial"
        },
        {
          "t": "he showed ",
          "g": "predicate"
        },
        {
          "t": "a familiar expression of impatience,",
          "g": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00239",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "就像要努力听清我的结巴语言的人所常有的那种焦躁的表情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the kind of impatient expression ",
          "g": "object"
        },
        {
          "t": "often seen in people ",
          "g": "attributive"
        },
        {
          "t": "who are trying hard to make out my stammering speech.",
          "g": "attributive"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
